REM SOURCE ONLY. No automatic execution. Owner must review local helpers first.
REM Put the reviewed capture directory at Desktop\EvilDuckTest. Normal PowerShell policy applies.
REM This opens a visible helper; the owner must still click Start. Never auto-type the phrase.
GUI r
